message: "If you use or build on Deepshot Studio, please credit its author and the Vathography practice that inspired it."
title: "Deepshot Studio"
abstract: "A local desktop application that creates images from the depth of a photograph: depth estimation with Marigold, a colour ramp, depth bands, 3D areas, lens blur and a stack of effects."
